OL,3,AUK net migration falls to 77,000 in
OL,4,Ayear to June 2026 - lowest since 1997,
OL,5,Aoutside pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK net migration fell to 77,000 in the
OL,8,Fyear to June 2026 - the lowest it's
OL,9,Fbeen since 1997, excluding the Covid
OL,10,Fpandemic
OL,12,FThe fall was mainly driven by lower net
OL,13,Fmigration among non-EU+ nationals, data
OL,14,Ffrom the Office for National Statistics
OL,15,Fshows
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Home Office figures show
OL,18,F74,000 people claimed asylum in the UK
OL,19,Fin the year ending September 2026 - a
OL,20,Fthird fewer than in the previous year
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
